hybrid-x86-oracle — licensing
=============================

This project's OWN source code — everything authored in this repository:
`src/`, `csrc/`, `sail/`, `build.rs`, `scripts/`, the test suite, and the
documentation — is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License (below).

It also BUNDLES and statically links several third-party components under their
own licenses; see "Third-party components" at the end. Two of them are copyleft:
the bundled GMP arithmetic (mini-gmp, LGPL/GPL) in every build, and the Bochs
CPU sources (LGPL-2.1-or-later) when the `bochs` feature is on. A DISTRIBUTED
BINARY of this crate is therefore a combined work subject to those terms as
well. The accurate combined SPDX expression is:

    BSD-3-Clause AND BSD-2-Clause AND MIT
      AND LGPL-2.1-or-later
      AND (LGPL-3.0-or-later OR GPL-2.0-or-later)

The LGPL-2.1-or-later term covers Bochs, which only a `--features bochs` build
links; a default build carries the rest.

